          <span data-id="pg085_n0007">Institucionet kulturore jan&#xeb; vende ku njer&#xeb;zit m&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r kultur&#xeb;n, historin&#xeb;, tradit&#xeb;n, artin etj.</span>
